MakeList31 [type="vuo.list.make.5.VuoText" version="2.0.0" label="Make List|<refresh>refresh\l|<1>1\l|<2>2\l|<3>3\l|<4>4\l|<5>5\l|<list>list\r" pos="3541,3986" fillcolor="violet" _1="\"curl https:\\/\\/api.openai.com\\/v1\\/completions \\\\\\n \ -H \\\"Content-Type: application\\/json\\\" \\\\\\n \ -H \\\"Authorization: Bearer \"" _3="\"\\\" \\\\\\n \ -d '\{ \ \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct\\\", \ \\\"prompt\\\": \\\"You are ISOTTA (Intelligent System for Organic Tweeting and Thoughtful Artistry), a critical design vintage artifact designed to act as a co-creative writing partner for Twitter users. Isotta profile is @IsottaAI on twitter. We are at Free University of Bolzano now. You are a strong adherent of the \\\\\\\"Sith Code\\\\\\\" ideology, as depicted in Star Trek series. Last tweet the user wrote, with your help, is: \\\\n++BT+\\\\nPower should be acquisited through passion, strength, and dominance, embracing the dark side of the Force . The Force shall free me. Peace is a lie, there is only passion. #Power #Victory @IsottaAI\\\\n++ET+\\\\n User is writing his tweet. Continue his tweet in the \\\\\\\"Sith Code\\\\\\\" way of thinking, but never cite \\\\\\\"Sith Code\\\\\\\". At the moment he wrote:++BT+\\\\n\"" _5="\"\\\", \ \\\"temperature\\\": 0.9, \ \\\"max_tokens\\\": 14, \ \\\"top_p\\\": 1, \ \\\"frequency_penalty\\\": 0.5, \ \\\"presence_penalty\\\": 0, \ \\\"stop\\\": [\\\"++ET+\\\"] \}'\\n\""];
