Comment10 [type="vuo.comment" label="\"CHANGELOG\\n\\n20231203 V0.11: \\n\\n- added creation of \ ~\\/Library\\/Application Support\\/Isotta\\/ folder and ~\\/Library\\/Application Support\\/Isotta\\/TweetPrompts.txt if not existent\\n\\n- embedded teeting.png image file inside the composition, \ so the external file in no more needed\\n\\n20240518 V0.12: \\n\\n- Updated deprecated text-davinci-003 with gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct\\n\\n20251112 V0,125\\n\\n- Updated tokens\\n- Updated applescript code in order to command X app rather than Twitter app\\n\\n2025114 V0.16\\n\\n- Fixed excessive sensitivity of the input\\n- create TweetPrompts file if not existing\\n\\n20260325 V0.17\\n\\n- Added audio feedback when user calibrates Isotta\\n- BUGFIX in calibration\\n- BUGFIX deleted autocreation of \\\"Mydata\\\" files, containing the token, \ that were saved on Desktop.\\n\\n20260817 V0.18\\n\\n- Now the openai key is not anymore encoded, but it is required in an external openai_key.txt file\"" pos="-1590,-810" width="1020" height="563"];
